    "created_at": "2017-04-19T09:17:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-19T09:17:35Z",
    "body": "An implementation detail in V8 is not really sufficient reason not to look for a general solution, I think.\r\n\r\nAs for your code example, are you sure that's how the base URLs end up playing out? I'm pretty sure that's wrong. The base URL is the response's URL, not the request's URL.",
